              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ખસ — khas — \"an itchy rash; scabies\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગંદા પાણીથી બાળકને ખસ થઈ. gandā pāṇīthī bāḷakne khas thaī. The child got an itchy rash from dirty water."
